      <div n="5" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p5">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <note type="editorial">卷首無正面文字</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="inner_title" n="f005-left-c01" xml:id="u-f005-left-c01" xml:lang="lzh">今時醫談熱癇畧鈔</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f005-left-c02" xml:id="u-f005-left-c02" xml:lang="lzh">以此病名熱癇其意詳于本書</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f005-left-c03" xml:id="u-f005-left-c03" xml:lang="lzh">不分四時不論男婦老少卒然惡寒發熱或無寒熱</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f005-left-c04" xml:id="u-f005-left-c04" xml:lang="lzh">脉初洪大常數口渴引飲吐瀉或無吐腸鳴大便溏</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f005-left-c05" xml:id="u-f005-left-c05" xml:lang="lzh">瀉一二行須臾指末冷或不冷頭痛或無頭痛此証</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f005-left-c06" xml:id="u-f005-left-c06" xml:lang="lzh">發而一二時或半日一日迺發暈或暴厥也然下痢</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f005-left-c07" xml:id="u-f005-left-c07" xml:lang="lzh">便色青白或褐色帶紅或便如熱湯也若小兒者恰</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f005-left-c08" xml:id="u-f005-left-c08" xml:lang="lzh">似驚風之狀口渴天吊直視手足搐搦掣急身體反</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f005-left-c09" xml:id="u-f005-left-c09" xml:lang="lzh">張乃食頃若炊時而醒至其醒而喜眠睡頃刻復發</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f005-left-c10" xml:id="u-f005-left-c10" xml:lang="lzh">如斯者數次若過一周時而三日則皆死矣大人患</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f005-left-c11" xml:id="u-f005-left-c11" xml:lang="lzh">此病者多無卒厥惟睡眠昏沉大便溏泄無禁或自</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f005-left-c12" xml:id="u-f005-left-c12" xml:lang="lzh">利耳是病似驚風霍亂死不旋踵医者於兒者以為</ab>
          <ab type="library_stamp" n="f005-left-c13" xml:id="u-f005-left-c13">184766　大正7.3.31</ab>
          <ab type="library_stamp" n="f005-left-c14" xml:id="u-f005-left-c14">京都帝國大學圖書之印</ab>
          <ab type="library_stamp" n="f005-left-c15" xml:id="u-f005-left-c15">富士川游寄贈</ab>
          <ab type="library_stamp" n="f005-left-c16" xml:id="u-f005-left-c16">富士川氏藏</ab>
          <ab type="provenance_stamp" n="f005-left-c17" xml:id="u-f005-left-c17">高嶋家藏</ab>
          <note type="editorial">漢文卷首、藏章及朱點</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="6" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p6">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="body" n="f006-right-c01" xml:id="u-f006-right-c01" xml:lang="lzh">驚在壯者則以為霍乱卒痢不投温補灸炳而難十</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-right-c02" xml:id="u-f006-right-c02" xml:lang="lzh">救一□欲認其因而未知六氣所冒傷實積痰癖虚</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-right-c03" xml:id="u-f006-right-c03" xml:lang="lzh">實因於何焉其發也飲食動作如常而忽然發起矣</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-right-c04" xml:id="u-f006-right-c04" xml:lang="lzh">衆初看為至危施參附大料徒俟斃而已正徳年中</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-right-c05" xml:id="u-f006-right-c05" xml:lang="lzh">奈洲氏者寓張洲每遇此証便云似驚而非驚似暴</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-right-c06" xml:id="u-f006-right-c06" xml:lang="lzh">瀉而非暴瀉不可如之何也故譬之漁人乗孤舟遇</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-right-c07" xml:id="u-f006-right-c07" xml:lang="lzh">暴風也然未曉之治法焉蓋勢張之漁人遇狂風震</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-right-c08" xml:id="u-f006-right-c08" xml:lang="lzh">舩則呼曰遇早手也然此暴風起于海上也不能預</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-right-c09" xml:id="u-f006-right-c09" xml:lang="lzh">知焉雖素馴於海者未能辨晴雨雷震其為何之兆</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-right-c10" xml:id="u-f006-right-c10" xml:lang="lzh">只俄然有狂風折桂拔禾之變故比此証云尒耳</ab>
          <ab type="section_title" n="f006-right-c11" xml:id="u-f006-right-c11" xml:lang="lzh">查考引據</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-right-c12" xml:id="u-f006-right-c12" xml:lang="lzh">仲景法曰少隂病下痢清水色純青者熱在裏也大</ab>
          <ab type="head_note" n="f006-right-c13" xml:id="u-f006-right-c13">也</ab>
          <note type="editorial">續漢文立論至查考引據</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="body" n="f006-left-c01" xml:id="u-f006-left-c01" xml:lang="lzh">承氣湯下之云々又曰及于期則緩而救之則當以</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-left-c02" xml:id="u-f006-left-c02" xml:lang="lzh">寒藥養陰退陽但不合轉瀉若得陰氣漸生則可救</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-left-c03" xml:id="u-f006-left-c03" xml:lang="lzh">宜凉膈散云々又原病式熱類論曰三焦為水榖轉</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-left-c04" xml:id="u-f006-left-c04" xml:lang="lzh">化之道路熱氣甚則傳化失常而吐瀉霍乱火性燥</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-left-c05" xml:id="u-f006-left-c05" xml:lang="lzh">動故也云々準繩曰有夏月脾胃伏熱大吐瀉當解</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-left-c06" xml:id="u-f006-left-c06" xml:lang="lzh">暑熱不可專囘陽云々又医統曰一作客熱内結消</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-left-c07" xml:id="u-f006-left-c07" xml:lang="lzh">燥脂肉如虫之食云々且有口候</ab>
          <ab type="section_title" n="f006-left-c08" xml:id="u-f006-left-c08" xml:lang="lzh">認証大人小兒通用</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-left-c09" xml:id="u-f006-left-c09" xml:lang="lzh">大熱煩渇　頭痛如裂　大便溏泄　大便無臭</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-left-c10" xml:id="u-f006-left-c10" xml:lang="lzh">糞不青黒　昏沉不醒　胷中脹悶　心胸煩悶</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f006-left-c11" xml:id="u-f006-left-c11" xml:lang="lzh">昏悶煩躁　昏迷沉重　煩躁喜眠　不睡喜欠</ab>
          <ab type="section_title" n="f006-left-c12" xml:id="u-f006-left-c12" xml:lang="lzh">熱癇疑似之間宜先用之試之方</ab>
          <note type="editorial">續文及認証、入試方前題</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="7" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p7">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c01" xml:id="u-f007-right-c01" xml:lang="lzh">一方防風散瘧湯似風邪者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c02" xml:id="u-f007-right-c02" xml:lang="lzh">防　陳　辛　金銀花　売　荊等分　水煎不用</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c03" xml:id="u-f007-right-c03" xml:lang="lzh">姜或去荊芥用薄荷亦佳　又曰萎天花翹藿薷紫</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c04" xml:id="u-f007-right-c04" xml:lang="lzh">独菊莪索田查枳腹朴青山豆根射干雷查富子之</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c05" xml:id="u-f007-right-c05" xml:lang="lzh">類須随証加減代用痘疹初発或外感之主方</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c06" xml:id="u-f007-right-c06" xml:lang="lzh">一方薄荷湯似暑邪者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c07" xml:id="u-f007-right-c07" xml:lang="lzh">薄　薷　翹各一匁　朴　銀　通各七分　水煎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c08" xml:id="u-f007-right-c08" xml:lang="lzh">又方紫蘇厚朴湯前方不効則以此方</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c09" xml:id="u-f007-right-c09" xml:lang="lzh">蘇　薷　朴　売　紅　青　陳　富　查　水</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c10" xml:id="u-f007-right-c10" xml:lang="lzh">煎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c11" xml:id="u-f007-right-c11" xml:lang="lzh">一方稜木湯似食積者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-right-c12" xml:id="u-f007-right-c12" xml:lang="lzh">稜　莪　富　青　委　枳　實　水煎</ab>
          <note type="editorial">方名與藥味</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c01" xml:id="u-f007-left-c01" xml:lang="lzh">又方紫朴湯治証同</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c02" xml:id="u-f007-left-c02" xml:lang="lzh">朴　查　富　稜　莪　實　翹　青　陳　辛</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c03" xml:id="u-f007-left-c03" xml:lang="lzh">水煎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c04" xml:id="u-f007-left-c04" xml:lang="lzh">一方射干兜苓湯似傷風咳嗽者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c05" xml:id="u-f007-left-c05" xml:lang="lzh">射　末　兜苓　桔　薄　蔘　花粉　貝　売</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c06" xml:id="u-f007-left-c06" xml:lang="lzh">菊　銀　水煎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c07" xml:id="u-f007-left-c07" xml:lang="lzh">一方沉香欝金散似寒邪無熱者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c08" xml:id="u-f007-left-c08" xml:lang="lzh">沉　蜜　蔚各一匁　委三匁　降眞香</ab>
          <ab type="prescription_minor" n="f007-left-c09" xml:id="u-f007-left-c09" xml:lang="lzh">二匁玉衡右細</ab>
          <ab type="prescription_minor" n="f007-left-c10" xml:id="u-f007-left-c10" xml:lang="lzh">辛五匁</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c11" xml:id="u-f007-left-c11" xml:lang="lzh">右細末砂仁湯下之</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c12" xml:id="u-f007-left-c12" xml:lang="lzh">又方三香散過服寒冷凝滯者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c13" xml:id="u-f007-left-c13" xml:lang="lzh">蜜　沉　白檀等分右細末砂仁湯下</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f007-left-c14" xml:id="u-f007-left-c14" xml:lang="lzh">又方三香丸同症痞悶者</ab>
          <note type="editorial">方書連續</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="8" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p8">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c01" xml:id="u-f008-right-c01" xml:lang="lzh">蜜　沉　檀各五匁　砂　富各八匁　五灵子六匁</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c02" xml:id="u-f008-right-c02" xml:lang="lzh">右水為丸</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c03" xml:id="u-f008-right-c03" xml:lang="lzh">一方藿香湯感穢氣者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c04" xml:id="u-f008-right-c04" xml:lang="lzh">藿　莎各四匁　薄七分　売　查　翹各十匁　水煎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c05" xml:id="u-f008-right-c05" xml:lang="lzh">一方沉香丸胸腹脹痛迷悶昏沉者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c06" xml:id="u-f008-right-c06" xml:lang="lzh">沉　枳各五匁　富　實　朴各七匁　稜　莪　陳</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c07" xml:id="u-f008-right-c07" xml:lang="lzh">天仙子各六匁　醜　委各四匁　蜜　姜黄各三匁</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c08" xml:id="u-f008-right-c08" xml:lang="lzh">右十三味為末砂仁湯下</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c09" xml:id="u-f008-right-c09" xml:lang="lzh">一方當飯枳實湯消食順氣和血</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c10" xml:id="u-f008-right-c10" xml:lang="lzh">飯尾　売　栩各一匁　查　富各二各　朴八分　水</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c11" xml:id="u-f008-right-c11" xml:lang="lzh">煎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-right-c12" xml:id="u-f008-right-c12" xml:lang="lzh">一方清氣化痰湯痰氣壅盛者盛玉衡作案</ab>
          <note type="editorial">方書連續</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c01" xml:id="u-f008-left-c01" xml:lang="lzh">貝二匁　姜黄一匁　辛　陳各六分　香　朴各七分　荊</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c02" xml:id="u-f008-left-c02" xml:lang="lzh">六分　委五分水煎冲砂仁末服</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c03" xml:id="u-f008-left-c03" xml:lang="lzh">一方烏氣順氣湯治内攻之劑</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c04" xml:id="u-f008-left-c04" xml:lang="lzh">莪　富　索　稜　歸各一分　売　青　委各八</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c05" xml:id="u-f008-left-c05" xml:lang="lzh">分　紅七分　莎四分　水煎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c06" xml:id="u-f008-left-c06" xml:lang="lzh">大人部小兒通用</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c07" xml:id="u-f008-left-c07" xml:lang="lzh">一方荊芥湯似鬱氣者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c08" xml:id="u-f008-left-c08" xml:lang="lzh">荊　防各一匁　芎三分　陳　青　翹各八分　右水</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c09" xml:id="u-f008-left-c09" xml:lang="lzh">煎食不消加查富心煩熱去芎加梔黒炒有積加</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c10" xml:id="u-f008-left-c10" xml:lang="lzh">枳痰多加貝歸氣壅加委莎血壅加桃紅鬱悶不</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c11" xml:id="u-f008-left-c11" xml:lang="lzh">舒加辛食積加稜莪大便不通加通沢喉痛去芎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f008-left-c12" xml:id="u-f008-left-c12" xml:lang="lzh">加薄射干大力子咳嗽加末兜苓</ab>
          <note type="editorial">方書連續</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="9" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p9">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c01" xml:id="u-f009-right-c01" xml:lang="lzh">一方陳皮厚朴湯似氣阻者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c02" xml:id="u-f009-right-c02" xml:lang="lzh">陳　朴　查　委　青　右水煎　痰多加歸貝</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c03" xml:id="u-f009-right-c03" xml:lang="lzh">血滯加索桃莎頭汗加實虎口渇加天花薄</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c04" xml:id="u-f009-right-c04" xml:lang="lzh">一方防風勝金湯似食積血滯者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c05" xml:id="u-f009-right-c05" xml:lang="lzh">防　委　索　吉　売各七分　富二匁　枳　銀</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c06" xml:id="u-f009-right-c06" xml:lang="lzh">查　翹　栩各一匁　水煎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c07" xml:id="u-f009-right-c07" xml:lang="lzh">一方必勝湯似血實者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c08" xml:id="u-f009-right-c08" xml:lang="lzh">紅　莎　桃　虎　貝　查　栩　青　灵　右</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c09" xml:id="u-f009-right-c09" xml:lang="lzh">水煎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c10" xml:id="u-f009-right-c10" xml:lang="lzh">一方独活紅花湯似血鬱者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c11" xml:id="u-f009-right-c11" xml:lang="lzh">独　紅　委　蒲黄　索　白蒺炒為末　委各一</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-right-c12" xml:id="u-f009-right-c12" xml:lang="lzh">匁　莎三分　売七分　水煎</ab>
          <note type="editorial">方書連續</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-left-c01" xml:id="u-f009-left-c01" xml:lang="lzh">一方清凉至宝飲清熱劑小兒最宜</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-left-c02" xml:id="u-f009-left-c02" xml:lang="lzh">薄　骨　牡丹　危黒　蔘　花粉　辛各等分</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-left-c03" xml:id="u-f009-left-c03" xml:lang="lzh">右水煎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-left-c04" xml:id="u-f009-left-c04" xml:lang="lzh">一方救苦丹病勢鬱悶者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-left-c05" xml:id="u-f009-left-c05" xml:lang="lzh">實　富各一匁　鬱二匁　委　翹各八分　右末茶</ab>
          <ab type="section_title" n="f009-left-c06" xml:id="u-f009-left-c06" xml:lang="lzh">丸散之部</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-left-c07" xml:id="u-f009-left-c07" xml:lang="lzh">一方牛黄丸痰喘者玉衡作痰涎喘急</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-left-c08" xml:id="u-f009-left-c08" xml:lang="lzh">胆南星　天竹黄各三匁　雄黄五匁　辰五分　丁香</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-left-c09" xml:id="u-f009-left-c09" xml:lang="lzh">牛黄各四匁　甘草　水為丸姜湯下</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-left-c10" xml:id="u-f009-left-c10" xml:lang="lzh">一方沉香阿魏丸氣壅血阻昏迷不醒偏身沉重不</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-left-c11" xml:id="u-f009-left-c11" xml:lang="lzh">能轉側者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f009-left-c12" xml:id="u-f009-left-c12" xml:lang="lzh">灵　陳各十匁　青　天仙子　姜黄　莪　稜各</ab>
          <note type="editorial">方書並丸散之部</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="10" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p10">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c01" xml:id="u-f010-right-c01" xml:lang="lzh">七匁　實六匁　白豆仁　委各五匁　蜜　沉各二匁</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c02" xml:id="u-f010-right-c02" xml:lang="lzh">阿魏一匁　右十三味為末</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c03" xml:id="u-f010-right-c03" xml:lang="lzh">一方宝花散通治方口傳</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c04" xml:id="u-f010-right-c04" xml:lang="lzh">鬱一匁　辛三十匁　降眞香三匁　荊四匁　右四味末</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c05" xml:id="u-f010-right-c05" xml:lang="lzh">清茶服</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c06" xml:id="u-f010-right-c06" xml:lang="lzh">證候既具七八状者</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c07" xml:id="u-f010-right-c07" xml:lang="lzh">芍藥湯　奪命金丹　牛黄丸　紫金錠　豐心</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c08" xml:id="u-f010-right-c08" xml:lang="lzh">丹　金銀煎汁　右常用多方</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c09" xml:id="u-f010-right-c09" xml:lang="lzh">大熱方此方未試治氣結胷膈中熱在胃脘飲食呕</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c10" xml:id="u-f010-right-c10" xml:lang="lzh">逆渇者方</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c11" xml:id="u-f010-right-c11" xml:lang="lzh">前　實　桂　虎　知母　寒水石　耳各十匁</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-right-c12" xml:id="u-f010-right-c12" xml:lang="lzh">硝石　膏　栝蔞根各十匁　右水煎</ab>
          <note type="editorial">續丸散等方</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="section_title" n="f010-left-c01" xml:id="u-f010-left-c01" xml:lang="lzh">用藥主能大人小兒通用</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-left-c02" xml:id="u-f010-left-c02" xml:lang="lzh">発表　荊　防　前　辛　獨</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-left-c03" xml:id="u-f010-left-c03" xml:lang="lzh">和食　陳　青　實　売　縮</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-left-c04" xml:id="u-f010-left-c04" xml:lang="lzh">清熱　翹　柴　葛　薄　蔘　化　童便</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-left-c05" xml:id="u-f010-left-c05" xml:lang="lzh">解毒　辛　降　鬱</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-left-c06" xml:id="u-f010-left-c06" xml:lang="lzh">醒穢　藿　檀　丁　降　沉</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-left-c07" xml:id="u-f010-left-c07" xml:lang="lzh">化痰　貝　歸　来　兜苓　杏　愛　関　雄黄</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-left-c08" xml:id="u-f010-left-c08" xml:lang="lzh">牛黄　胆星　天竹黄</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-left-c09" xml:id="u-f010-left-c09" xml:lang="lzh">行血破瘀　桃　芎　紅　銀　茜草　辛　姜黄</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-left-c10" xml:id="u-f010-left-c10" xml:lang="lzh">飯　灵　亀甲　索　蘓木　没薬</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-left-c11" xml:id="u-f010-left-c11" xml:lang="lzh">消食化積　查　富　芽　曲　稜　莪　朴　虎</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f010-left-c12" xml:id="u-f010-left-c12" xml:lang="lzh">魏</ab>
          <note type="editorial">用藥主能表</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="11" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p11">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-right-c01" xml:id="u-f011-right-c01" xml:lang="lzh">令吐食　明礬　食塩</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-right-c02" xml:id="u-f011-right-c02" xml:lang="lzh">通水　通　沢　車前</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-right-c03" xml:id="u-f011-right-c03" xml:lang="lzh">順氣　莎　蜜　辛</ab>
          <ab type="section_title" n="f011-right-c04" xml:id="u-f011-right-c04" xml:lang="lzh">雑</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-right-c05" xml:id="u-f011-right-c05" xml:lang="lzh">化　桔　皂刺　朱房　晩　蚕砂　大麻人　鬱　檀　丁　藿</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-right-c06" xml:id="u-f011-right-c06" xml:lang="lzh">温劑　白荳蔻　砂人　蜜　丁香</ab>
          <ab type="section_title" n="f011-right-c07" xml:id="u-f011-right-c07" xml:lang="lzh">他家秘方</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-right-c08" xml:id="u-f011-right-c08" xml:lang="lzh">明礬寒晒一匁　丁香五分　右為末</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-right-c09" xml:id="u-f011-right-c09" xml:lang="lzh">一方同前　辰一匁　葛粉三分　参五分　右末白湯用</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-right-c10" xml:id="u-f011-right-c10" xml:lang="lzh">同前</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-right-c11" xml:id="u-f011-right-c11" xml:lang="lzh">一方紫吾一匁　百沸煎　辰各三分　右末白湯用</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-right-c12" xml:id="u-f011-right-c12" xml:lang="lzh">不可謾用薬品　熟芐　芍　参　附　耆　伽</ab>
          <note type="editorial">藥用分類、他家秘方及不可誤用</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-left-c01" xml:id="u-f011-left-c01" xml:lang="lzh">預　甘　狄　守　壮　蒼　朮　味　竹　桂</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-left-c02" xml:id="u-f011-left-c02" xml:lang="lzh">呉茱　麻黄　熱湯　熱粥　酒　姜　灸</ab>
          <ab type="prescription" n="f011-left-c03" xml:id="u-f011-left-c03" xml:lang="lzh">不得已用薬品　連　芩　生芐　瀝　天花</ab>
          <note type="editorial">禁用／不得已用藥末三欄</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="12" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p12">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <note type="editorial">有第11幅左的反面透背，無正面正文</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="section_title" n="f012-left-c01" xml:id="u-f012-left-c01" xml:lang="ja">熱癇ノ病心得ノ事</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f012-left-c02" xml:id="u-f012-left-c02" xml:lang="ja">一此病夏ニ限ラス四時共ニアリテ又小兒斗リ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f012-left-c03" xml:id="u-f012-left-c03" xml:lang="ja">病ニアラス大人老人ニモマヽコレアル事</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f012-left-c04" xml:id="u-f012-left-c04" xml:lang="ja">一此病ノ様子一ヤウニ定ナシト云モ大方ハ俄</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f012-left-c05" xml:id="u-f012-left-c05" xml:lang="ja">ニ惡寒發熱ヲイタシ脈浮数口渇シ湯水ヲ好</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f012-left-c06" xml:id="u-f012-left-c06" xml:lang="ja">ミ頭痛甚ク腸鳴テ大便瀉シ其大便事ノ外熱</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f012-left-c07" xml:id="u-f012-left-c07" xml:lang="ja">ク覚エ初二三度下ル間ハ大便常ノ通臭シ三</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f012-left-c08" xml:id="u-f012-left-c08" xml:lang="ja">四度多下リテ後ハ大便不臭五色ノ腸垢交リ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f012-left-c09" xml:id="u-f012-left-c09" xml:lang="ja">下リ又ハ吐逆スル事有熱強ク悶苦ムマモヒ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f012-left-c10" xml:id="u-f012-left-c10" xml:lang="ja">クモノ眠リ一二時程ニシテ目ヲミツメ手足</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f012-left-c11" xml:id="u-f012-left-c11" xml:lang="ja">ヒクメキ又ハ掣引シ背ヘ反リナトシ暫クシ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f012-left-c12" xml:id="u-f012-left-c12" xml:lang="ja">コルニ又掣引シ二三度四五度モ如此シ其間ニ</ab>
          <note type="editorial">和文「熱癇ノ病心得ノ事」開始</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="paratext">
          <ab type="detached_label" n="f012-slip-c01" xml:id="u-f012-slip-c01">今時醫談熱癇畧</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="13" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p13">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <note type="editorial">第12幅右同面重拍</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <note type="editorial">第12幅左同面重拍</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="paratext">
          <ab type="detached_label" n="f013-slip-c01" xml:id="u-f013-slip-c01">東京四谷尾張丁</ab>
          <ab type="detached_label" n="f013-slip-c02" xml:id="u-f013-slip-c02">高島祐啓</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="14" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p14">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c01" xml:id="u-f014-right-c01" xml:lang="ja">ハヨク眠ルナリ如此事一日半日ニシテ死シ長</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c02" xml:id="u-f014-right-c02" xml:lang="ja">キハ二三日程ニテ死ス或ハ只一度引付テ直</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c03" xml:id="u-f014-right-c03" xml:lang="ja">ニ死スルモアリ一様ニハアラス又熱ノナキ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c04" xml:id="u-f014-right-c04" xml:lang="ja">モアリ熱ノナキヲ早テト見立事巧者ノ働キ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c05" xml:id="u-f014-right-c05" xml:lang="ja">有コトヽ大人ハ筋骨剛キユヘ多クハ引付ナ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c06" xml:id="u-f014-right-c06" xml:lang="ja">シ只氣分沈ミ陷ルヤウニ重クネタキ枕ニテ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c07" xml:id="u-f014-right-c07" xml:lang="ja">ウカ〳〵トシウツ〳〵ノ様ニ覚ユルモアリ小兒</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c08" xml:id="u-f014-right-c08" xml:lang="ja">ハ疱瘡ノ初發驚風ホトニ紛レ大人ハ暑氣アタ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c09" xml:id="u-f014-right-c09" xml:lang="ja">リ霍亂暴瀉ホトニ紛レテ見分カタキ事アリ第</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c10" xml:id="u-f014-right-c10" xml:lang="ja">一ノ見立病苦甚キ閒ニモ喜眠ルト大便ノ不</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c11" xml:id="u-f014-right-c11" xml:lang="ja">臭ヲ以前ノ見立ス其外々見立ハ素人ニテ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-right-c12" xml:id="u-f014-right-c12" xml:lang="ja">ハナリカタシ或ハ不眠シ欠ヒ紛スルモアリ</ab>
          <note type="editorial">和文心得</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c01" xml:id="u-f014-left-c01" xml:lang="ja">有増如此ニシ見立ニ初者アル事ト知ベシ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c02" xml:id="u-f014-left-c02" xml:lang="ja">一療治方藥方等ハ醫者ニアラサレハ合點ナラ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c03" xml:id="u-f014-left-c03" xml:lang="ja">サル事故コヽニ不記然レド禁物藥ニテハ附</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c04" xml:id="u-f014-left-c04" xml:lang="ja">子肉桂乾姜黄芪ホトナリ又酒ト魚トヲ忌又煎</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c05" xml:id="u-f014-left-c05" xml:lang="ja">茶粥米湯白湯ホモ熱キハ禁物也ヌルクシ用</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c06" xml:id="u-f014-left-c06" xml:lang="ja">ユベシ人參モ禁物ノ内ナレド是ハ様子ニ依</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c07" xml:id="u-f014-left-c07" xml:lang="ja">テ少ヽ用ユル事モアリ然シ人參ヲ用事ハ病</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c08" xml:id="u-f014-left-c08" xml:lang="ja">人百人ニ一二人ナラテハ無之事夫ド無用ニ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c09" xml:id="u-f014-left-c09" xml:lang="ja">ハ益多シ用方ニハ損多ト知ベシ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c10" xml:id="u-f014-left-c10" xml:lang="ja">一此病ノ根元ハ人ノ生稟ノ丈夫不丈夫食餌ノ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c11" xml:id="u-f014-left-c11" xml:lang="ja">好惡ニモヨラス又風邪寒氣溫氣食餌ホトニモ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f014-left-c12" xml:id="u-f014-left-c12" xml:lang="ja">非ス病氣ト云テ毒ノ氣也其毒氣鼻口ヨリ入</ab>
          <note type="editorial">和文心得</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="15" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p15">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c01" xml:id="u-f015-right-c01" xml:lang="ja">テ先血分ニ入リ急ニ藏府ヲ攻大熱ヲ發シ腹</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c02" xml:id="u-f015-right-c02" xml:lang="ja">中ノ脂膜ト盲脂ヲトロカシ能心ノ藏攻ル故</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c03" xml:id="u-f015-right-c03" xml:lang="ja">ニ氣ウカツキテ引付ヲナス也手足甚冷ト云</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c04" xml:id="u-f015-right-c04" xml:lang="ja">ド寒證ト思ベカラス惣身ニ熱ナキ症ニテモ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c05" xml:id="u-f015-right-c05" xml:lang="ja">内ハ熱毒ノ病也此毒氣内ニ有ル閒ハ矢ノ中リ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c06" xml:id="u-f015-right-c06" xml:lang="ja">テ不拔様ナルモノナリ治ル事ナク瀉カ吐カ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c07" xml:id="u-f015-right-c07" xml:lang="ja">汗カニテ外エ發シキラサレハ終ニハ死ス夫</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c08" xml:id="u-f015-right-c08" xml:lang="ja">故瀉スル事ヲ厭ベカラスマヽ不瀉症アリテ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c09" xml:id="u-f015-right-c09" xml:lang="ja">却テ事ノ外六ケ敷早ク死スルモノナリ毒氣</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c10" xml:id="u-f015-right-c10" xml:lang="ja">不去故ナリ吐モ瀉モ汗モ毒氣ノ洩ルヽ道也</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c11" xml:id="u-f015-right-c11" xml:lang="ja">服藥ニテ此毒ヲ解散スル事第一ノ心得ナリ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-right-c12" xml:id="u-f015-right-c12" xml:lang="ja">若下リ止ル藥カ又附子肉桂乾姜ナト用灸ナ</ab>
          <note type="editorial">和文心得</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c01" xml:id="u-f015-left-c01" xml:lang="ja">トスヱテ毒氣留ル時ハ治スベキ理ナシ此事</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c02" xml:id="u-f015-left-c02" xml:lang="ja">病家ノ肝腎ノ心得ナリ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c03" xml:id="u-f015-left-c03" xml:lang="ja">一病人アリテ何トヤラニ□ナラシキ心元ナキ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c04" xml:id="u-f015-left-c04" xml:lang="ja">様子アラハ先金子三五兩水ニテヨク洗ヒ水</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c05" xml:id="u-f015-left-c05" xml:lang="ja">三四杯トヒンニ入テ煎シ迹ヨリ水ヲサシ煎</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c06" xml:id="u-f015-left-c06" xml:lang="ja">シメテ置ヘシ服藥ノ煎水丸藥ノ送汁皆此水</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c07" xml:id="u-f015-left-c07" xml:lang="ja">ニヨシ若醫者ヲ招ク事遅クハ先此金汁斗リ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c08" xml:id="u-f015-left-c08" xml:lang="ja">ヲヌルクシ用ヒテ醫ヲマツベシ其閒ニ引付</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c09" xml:id="u-f015-left-c09" xml:lang="ja">ル事アラハ手足ヲ摩テ脊骨ヲ按テ右ノ金汁</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c10" xml:id="u-f015-left-c10" xml:lang="ja">ヲシメタキヲ少ク用テ良薬杯不通トテ鼻ヨ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c11" xml:id="u-f015-left-c11" xml:lang="ja">リ吹入又ハ灸ナトスユル事大ニ惡キコトニ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f015-left-c12" xml:id="u-f015-left-c12" xml:lang="ja">大音ニテ喚醒スコト無益ニ脊ト胸腹ト□撫</ab>
          <note type="editorial">和文心得</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="16" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p16">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c01" xml:id="u-f016-right-c01" xml:lang="ja">テ穩ルベシ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c02" xml:id="u-f016-right-c02" xml:lang="ja">一病出シ子半日モ過テ大便繁ク下レハ腹中ノ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c03" xml:id="u-f016-right-c03" xml:lang="ja">脂拔テ元氣持カタシ粥カ米湯カ折フシ灌ヘ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c04" xml:id="u-f016-right-c04" xml:lang="ja">シ味噌汁タマリ塩ノ類ヲヨキホドニクワユ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c05" xml:id="u-f016-right-c05" xml:lang="ja">用ユヘシ淡キ粥米湯斗リニテハ藥ヲウケヌ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c06" xml:id="u-f016-right-c06" xml:lang="ja">様ナルモノ也塩味噌絶レハ湯水通リ難シ此</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c07" xml:id="u-f016-right-c07" xml:lang="ja">事病家最一ノ心得ナリ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c08" xml:id="u-f016-right-c08" xml:lang="ja">一此病人ニ藥ヨク適ヘハ毒氣ハヤクヌケテ治</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c09" xml:id="u-f016-right-c09" xml:lang="ja">驗コトノホカハヤキモノナリ一兩日ニテ平</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c10" xml:id="u-f016-right-c10" xml:lang="ja">生底ニナルモノナリ初メヨリ適中スル時ハ</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c11" xml:id="u-f016-right-c11" xml:lang="ja">ヒキ付ナリ治スル事アリハヤク治シタリト</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-right-c12" xml:id="u-f016-right-c12" xml:lang="ja">テ熱病ニアラス油斷スヘカラス又ハ痢病ト</ab>
          <note type="editorial">和文心得</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="body" n="f016-left-c01" xml:id="u-f016-left-c01" xml:lang="ja">ナリ脾胃虛トナリ小疳トナルモアリ油斷ス</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f016-left-c02" xml:id="u-f016-left-c02" xml:lang="ja">ベカラス</ab>
          <note type="editorial">末兩欄，止「油斷スベカラズ」</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="17" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p17">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <note type="editorial">末反面透背</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="end_annotation" n="f017-left-c01" xml:id="u-f017-left-c01">□□□</ab>
          <note type="editorial">封底內側左下草書署記</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="18" type="scan" corresp="https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00002628/canvas/p18">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <note type="editorial">原冊棕色封底</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <note type="editorial">原冊棕色封底</note>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
